win the gold medal in the 1,500 metres when he outran " [:a {:href "/athletes/78508"} "Brutus Hamilton"] " by 9.4 seconds.  In an interview many years later, when asked if he could have defeated Thorpe in his prime, Løvland replied, “Oh, no, he was too good.”"] "\n\n" [:p {} "With 30 years, 102 days by the time he won this event, Helge Løvland remained the oldest Olympic decathlon champion in history for 100 years. At Tokyo 2020 (actually competed in 2021), the Canadian " [:a {:href "/athletes/122729"} "Damian Warner"] " finally beat Løvland’s age record, winning the " [:a {:href "/results/19000594"} "Olympic decathlon"] " at 31 years, 274 days."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "Points"] [:th {} "Points (1934 Tables)"] [:th {} "Points (1952 Tables)"] [:th {} "Points (1962 Tables)"] [:th {} "Points (1985 Hand Tables)"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "541"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/74187"} "Helge Løvland"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/NOR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/NOR.png"}] "NOR"]] [:td {} "6803.3550"] [:td {} "6013"] [:td {} "5190"] [:td {} "5970"] [:td {} "5803"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "176"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/78508"} "Brutus Hamilton"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/USA.png"}] "USA"]] [:td {} "6771.2750"] [:td {} "5952"] [:td {} "5111"] [:td {} "5940"] [:td {} "5739"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "615"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/76341"} "Bertil Ohlson"]] [